Task 1: Set up Automation Mesh Infrastructure
Subtask 1.1: Understand Automation Mesh Architecture
An Automation Mesh is a distributed network of nodes that enables Ansible automation to scale across multiple locations, data centers, or cloud regions. The mesh consists of:

• Control Nodes: Run the Automation Controller and manage job execution • Execution Nodes: Execute automation jobs and playbooks • Hop Nodes: Relay communication between nodes across network boundaries

